This project is an independent port of the Muse Gadget protocol for Samsung
Tizen TVs. The protocol implementation (device API client, Noise XX session,
control-stream framing, pairing v5) is derived from Meta's Muse Gadget SDK:

    Muse Gadget SDK
    Copyright (c) Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates.
    https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Derived does not mean copied wholesale: each module in app/js is a fresh
JavaScript implementation written against the SDK's Python sources, which
are named file-by-file in PROTOCOL.md. The pairing test vectors in
tests/fixtures/link_pairing_v5.json are reproduced from the SDK's
linux/tests/vectors/ for verification; they are public synthetic test data.

The Apache License does not cover the "Jollybot" avatar artwork in the
SDK's esp32/avatar/ directory. This project contains none of it: the icon
and all artwork here are original to this project.

